      en: "Silum is a mountain settlement in the municipality of Triesenberg, perched on a ridge high above the Rhine Valley. The village consists of traditional Walser houses and holiday cabins harmoniously embedded in the alpine landscape. Silum is known for its peaceful atmosphere and extensive views of the Swiss mountains. It often serves as a stopover for hikers on their way to the Kulm or other peaks in the region.",
