      en: "Rotenboden is a district of the municipality of Triesenberg, situated on the steep slopes of the Rhine Valley. The settlement is characterized by a sparse development of traditional and modern houses, all benefiting from the sunny western exposure. Rotenboden offers expansive views over the Liechtenstein lowlands and the Swiss plain. Hiking trails connect the district directly to the center of Triesenberg and higher alpine areas.",
